      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T15:19:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This ends up losing the call to GPU-\u003echeckVkResult() done in the previous macro. Would GR_VK_CALL_RESULT_NOCHECK work?\n\nI also wonder if GR_VK_CALL_RESULT_NOCHECK should also be calling GR_VK_LOG_IF_NOT_SUCCESS so you could avoid the need to manually log below? Though there might be other call sites where we explicitly don\u0027t want that? I forget all its uses.",
