        "id": 14669
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T19:58:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e This ends up losing the call to GPU-\u003echeckVkResult() done in the previous macro. Would GR_VK_CALL_RESULT_NOCHECK work?\n\nYeah that works. checkVkResult() might get called with VK_TMIEOUT before real result call but that is a no-op.\n\n\u003e I also wonder if GR_VK_CALL_RESULT_NOCHECK should also be calling GR_VK_LOG_IF_NOT_SUCCESS so you could avoid the need to manually log below? Though there might be other call sites where we explicitly don\u0027t want that? I forget all its uses.\n\nSome uses have their own logging afterwards already so this is similar. They also pretty much all call checkVkResult() explicitly which I guess isn\u0027t harmful but seems wrong. I\u0027m going to leave it as is?",
      "parentUuid": "f8c7bcfa_496f7225",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 700,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 700,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "c21b33259bfb20cf55368d2eefc8f98d5db9f597",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "163820de_3b6153ce",
        "filename": "src/gpu/ganesh/vk/GrVkCommandBuffer.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 702,
      "author": {
        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T15:19:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if we should make a call in GrVkCaps like GrVkCaps::mustRecallWaitForFences() and have that only return true for older mali devices. The update this loop do be a do/while loop with the condition being while(vkCaps-\u003emustRecallWaitForFences() \u0026\u0026 result \u003d\u003d VK_TIMEOUT).\n\nThat way we can both comment the need for the workaround in the GrVkCaps file and also serve as a reminder to remove it if we ever stop supporting those old devices.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 699,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 702,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "c21b33259bfb20cf55368d2eefc8f98d5db9f597",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
